  "notes": "r3 facing fix of njh_rumah_biasa. I1 sofa has no true back view (rot 180 still shows the cushions toward +r), so the sofa stays rot 0 (visible front +r) and the TV moves to higher r with rot 180 (true screen-back sprite) so the screen faces the sofa. Kursi rot 90 faces the meja across a 1-tile gap. Kompor/bak/shower rot 0 into the room; WC stays SW. flipX/flipY were inspected and rejected (flipX only mirrors L-R; flipY is upside-down).",
